gsndesign:dd-0122
    a gsndesign:RetiredDecision ;
    gsndesign:retirementReason "enumeration extended with “dialectic” in 1.2.3. It was written from Core GSN and never extended when the Dialectic Extension added the challenges relationship, so a reified challenge had no legal value and rule S50 was left creating untyped relationships, alone among the four relation-creating rules. Superseded by the extended enumeration recorded in the same release."@en ;
    gsndesign:positionKey "S03.R041" ;
    gsndesign:part gsndesign:part-0 ;
    gsndesign:section gsndesign:sec-part0-glossary ;
    gsndesign:formalism gsndesign:OWL ;
    gsndesign:naturalLanguage "A relationship type is recorded as one of contextual, evidential or inferential."@en ;
    gsndesign:nlWrittenFor "21b29182" ;
    prov:used gsndesign:src-0034 ;
    prov:generated gsndesign:st-0122 .

