    a gsndesign:RetiredDecision ;
    gsndesign:retirementReason "domain extended with gsn:Pattern in 1.2.3. In the Argument Pattern Extension the artefact that is developed and finalised is the pattern, and the domain named gsn:Argument alone, so the flag could not be carried by the pattern or template it describes. Superseded by the extended domain recorded in the same release."@en ;
