gsndesign:dd-0465
    a gsndesign:RetiredDecision ;
    gsndesign:retirementReason "range widened to admit GSN elements in 1.2.3. The range named only gsn:Template, which reads the class definition as though the reference attached to the template as a whole; the definition says the GSN argument below the attached element. Widened to a union rather than replaced, because gsn:Template is a gsn:Pattern and gsn:Pattern falls outside gsn:GSNElement, so a bare replacement would have made whole-template attachments illegal. Superseded by the widened range recorded in the same release."@en ;
    gsndesign:positionKey "S05.R148" ;
    gsndesign:part gsndesign:part-1 ;
    gsndesign:section gsndesign:sec-pattern ;
    gsndesign:formalism gsndesign:OWL ;
    gsndesign:naturalLanguage "Something can only be attached to a template."@en ;
    gsndesign:nlWrittenFor "35ea9130" ;
    prov:used gsndesign:src-0138 ;
    prov:generated gsndesign:st-0465 .

