gsndesign:dd-0798
    a gsndesign:RetiredDecision ;
    gsndesign:retirementReason "Superseded by dd-1011 and dd-1012: the artefact reference was required of every solution, so every uninstantiated solution in a pattern, and every uninstantiated copy in an instantiated argument, was warned about evidence it cannot have yet. The class check stays on gsnsh:SolutionShape (dd-1012); the minimum count moved to gsnsh:SolutionEvidenceShape (dd-1011), which exempts a solution flagged gsn:uninstantiated true."@en ;
    gsndesign:supersededBy gsndesign:dd-1012 ;
