gsndesign:dd-0954
    a gsndesign:RetiredDecision ;
    gsndesign:retirementReason "Superseded in 1.2.4. gsn:Catalogue carries an owl:allValuesFrom restriction on gsn:contains but was absent from the domain, so every catalogue that held a pattern was inferred to be an argument, an assurance case, a module or a pattern. The SHACL shape compensated by listing gsn:Catalogue among the permitted subjects; the OWL axiom is where that belongs."@en ;
    gsndesign:supersededBy gsndesign:dd-0965 ;
    gsndesign:positionKey "S04.R142" ;
    gsndesign:part gsndesign:part-1 ;
